     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Harlan,<br><br>Any chance you can share the project (e.g. is it on GitHub)? I am wondering why a package named &#39;pkg&#39; is being picked up.<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br><br>Kevin</font></span><div>\r\n<div><br><br>On Wednesday, July 16, 2014 12:56:55 PM UTC-7, Harlan Harris wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi. I&#39;ve got a small project I developed in RStudio, and I&#39;d like to move it over to Packrat. Following the instructions, I&#39;ve installed v 0.3.0.105, along with devtools 1.5. However, I&#39;m getting this:<div>\r\n<br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> packrat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">init</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Initializing</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> packrat project </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> directory</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;/home/harlan/Development/<u></u>risk-model-report&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> findLocalRepoForPkg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pkg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> repos</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">No</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;pkg&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> found </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">local</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> repositories specified<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Warning</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> messages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> readLines</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n  incomplete </span><span style=\"color:#008\">final</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> line found on </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;/home/harlan/Development/<u></u>risk-model-report/risk-model-<u></u>report.Rmd&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FUN</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;data.table&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Rcmdr&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pscl&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pkg&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;rmarkdown&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)[[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5L</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;pkg&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> repository </span><span style=\"color:#008\">or</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> locally<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FUN</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;data.table&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Rcmdr&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pscl&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pkg&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;rmarkdown&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)[[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5L</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;rmarkdown&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> repository </span><span style=\"color:#008\">or</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> locally</span></div>\r\n</code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Any ideas? Thanks!</div><div><br></div><div> -Harlan</div><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
